  <item>
    <title>002.“朋友”是我们自己选择的亲人啊</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6658a1c294977a26ef147c32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6658a1c294977a26ef147c32</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 May 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“亲爱的朋友，你是我自己选择的家人啊！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-------仅以此集献给我们的朋友，希望我们友谊长存，人生漫漫一起走。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="113">00:01:53</a> 室友能成为朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">00:03:48</a> 寝室矛盾事件抓马大升级！！！？？？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">00:17:38</a> 朋友互助“收容所”超温暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">00:26:12</a> 室友相处的秘诀在于相互体谅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">00:29:40</a> 集体（住宿）生活是需要经验的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">00:30:40</a> 三个人的友情会拥挤么？友情也具有排他性？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">00:38:09</a> 遇到不舒服的事要直接说出来吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2510">00:41:50</a> 三观一致才能成为朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">00:45:00</a> 阶段式友谊：她再也没有和我一起关过那盏灯......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3350">00:55:50</a> 我会在以后每一个有关你的日子想起你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">00:57:30</a> 我从一年级玩的朋友，也一直是我六年级玩的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">01:02:00</a> 但她是个很洒脱，很有勇气的人......</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4045">01:07:25</a> 只是我单方面认为我们是好朋友吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">01:16:00</a> 正面反馈的重要性：向夸夸群“群主”学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4026">01:07:06</a> 朋友有恋人（家庭），你会自动选择后退吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4993">01:23:13</a> 朋友对你来说是什么？是另一个我；是我自己选择的亲人</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsFFVQlCe_Da1HDpQc5K9OFAIzG-.m4a" length="87835523" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqZe-dWRfUly5xrTc-DKiaOhR02e.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>2</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
